    "details": "<p><strong>About the Competition:</strong></p>\n<p>Pimpri Chinchwad College Of Engineering and Research, Pune<strong>, </strong>Computer Department presents <strong>CraftVerse 2.0 &ndash; 2026</strong>, a National Level Hackathon that brings together students, developers, designers, and tech enthusiasts to ideate, innovate, and implement impactful solutions to real-world challenges. Participants will collaborate in teams to propose problem statements, design prototypes, and refine their ideas with mentorship and guidance from industry experts.</p>\n<p>The hackathon is structured in <strong>two stages</strong>:</p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 (Online &ndash; Unstop Platform):</strong> PPT submission of the problem statement and proposed idea under one of the listed domains:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Artificial Intelligence &amp; Agentic AI</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cyber Security &amp; Digital Forensics</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Healthcare &amp; MedTech</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Sustainability &amp; Climate Technology</strong></li>\n<li><strong>FinTech &amp; Digital Economy</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cloud Computing, DevOps &amp; Developer Tools</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Open Innovation</strong> (Any impactful idea beyond the listed domains)</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Round 2 (Offline &ndash; PCCOER, Ravet):</strong> A <strong>2-day Overnight Coding Hackathon </strong>will be held on <strong>5<sup>th</sup> and 6<sup>th</sup> October</strong>, where shortlisted teams will build, evaluate, improve, and present their working prototypes over 30 hours of continuous innovation.</p>\n<p>Beyond the competition, CraftVerse 2.0 offers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mentorship &amp; Guidance </strong>from industry experts.</li>\n<li><strong>Skill Development </strong>in coding, design, problem-solving, and emerging technologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Networking Opportunities </strong>with peers, mentors, startups, and organizations.</li>\n<li>Rewards &amp; Recognition with a prize pool worth <strong>₹60,000+</strong> along with <strong>certificates and exciting rewards</strong>.</li>\n<li>Event Experience with a 2-day overnight coding environment, food, goodies, mentoring sessions, and interactive activities.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CraftVerse 2.0</strong> is more than a competition&mdash;it is a learning and growth experience that challenges participants to think critically, build creatively, collaborate effectively, and stand out as future innovators.</p>",
    "end_date": "2026-10-06T19:00:00+05:30",
